# A plain parameter needs no `prompt` mark (ruling PT is about events and dynamics): a
# value given plainly is fixed for the widget, and a result of no event or dynamic never
# fires. Found by the step 3 build: prismc's own `@CheckMain: fn [Text] -> @unit` was
# refused `prompt-unmarked`.
# Written by Claude on the claude-self-hosting branch; subject to change.
module PlainParameter
emit Ui.*

@Shown: fn Text -> @unit
fn @Shown label:
    Ui.Label($text=$"{label}")

@Doubled: fn Nat -> @Nat
fn @Doubled n:
    Ui.Label($text=$"{n}")
    @ n * 2
